  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nExplore the corrupted peninsula in a stunning hand drawn art style.<p></p>\n<p>You play as Herbert Westmark, paranormal investigator and curator of odd trinkets. Together with a parasite demon Ambrose you explore the map of Burrmouth to get to the bottom of why people here are missing. Where will your unhinged journey take you in this unique cosmic horror adventure?</p>\n<p>The stylish art will set the mood to a gothic horror adventure where Herbert tries to survive by using his skills, items and deck.</p>\n<p>This gothic horror adventure deck builder is inspired by the likes of H.P. Lovecraft, Stephen King and Mary Shelley to name a few.</p>\n<p>Equip items and relics; acquire cards and use them on the board to survive the darkest corners outside of town. An interesting dive into the unknown with a cosy horror atmosphere.</p>\n",
